{"seq":1,"slug":"listening-practice","title":"高三英语 — 听力训练","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/mock-practice/listening-practice","wordCount":2104,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-听力训练\">高三英语 — 听力训练</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>高考英语听力分值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分，占总分的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>，是所有题型中&quot;投入产出比&quot;最高的板块——听力的提分速度通常快于阅读和写作，且一旦掌握方法，分数稳定性极高。全国卷听力共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 题，分两节：第一节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 段短对话（各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 题，共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 题，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.5</span></span></span></span></span> 分），第二节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 段长对话/独白（各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 题，共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 题，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">22.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22.5</span></span></span></span></span> 分）。听力材料只播放一遍（部分省份播两遍），对考生的即时理解和信息捕捉能力要求很高。高三听力备考的核心不是&quot;多听&quot;，而是&quot;会听&quot;——掌握预判技巧、抓取关键信息、避开常见陷阱。</p>\n<p>高考听力题型与考查重点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>题型</th>\n<th>题量</th>\n<th>考查重点</th>\n<th>常见场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短对话</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 题</td>\n<td>关键信息提取、简单推理</td>\n<td>日常对话、询问信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长对话</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 段，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 题</td>\n<td>多信息整合、态度判断</td>\n<td>预约、讨论、咨询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独白</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 段，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 题</td>\n<td>篇章理解、细节记忆</td>\n<td>演讲、通知、旅行介绍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-听力的预判策略\">一、听力的预判策略</h3><p>听力考试中，利用播放指令和间歇时间预读题目是最关键的技巧。</p>\n<p><strong>预读时间分配</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>考试开始前的指令时间（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 秒）：预读第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 题</li>\n<li>每段听力之间的间歇（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 秒）：预读下一段的题目</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>预读要提取的信息</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>问题类型</strong>：who / what / when / where / why / how</li>\n<li><strong>场景线索</strong>：从选项推断可能的对话场景</li>\n<li><strong>关键差异</strong>：找出四个选项之间的区别，这些区别就是听的重点</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>例题预判</strong>：\n题目：Where does the conversation probably take place?\nA. In a hospital  B. In a restaurant  C. In a library</p>\n<p>预判：听力中会出现场景相关的词汇。医院相关词（doctor, medicine, appointment），餐厅相关词（menu, order, waiter），图书馆相关词（book, borrow, quiet）。集中注意力捕捉这些场景标志词。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-关键信息捕捉技巧\">二、关键信息捕捉技巧</h3><p>高考听力的答案通常由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个关键词决定。有效听力不是逐词翻译，而是&quot;选择性聆听&quot;——抓住与题目相关的关键信息。</p>\n<p><strong>数字信息题</strong>：</p>\n<p>数字是听力中最常考的信息类型之一。注意：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考查类型</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>提到多个时间，只有最终确认的才是答案</td>\n<td>听清 &quot;changed to&quot; / &quot;actually&quot; 后的修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格</td>\n<td>原价和折扣价混淆</td>\n<td>听清 &quot;with a discount&quot; / &quot;for each&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>多个数量叠加</td>\n<td>注意 &quot;in total&quot; / &quot;altogether&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电话号码</td>\n<td>数字连读听不清</td>\n<td>练习 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 的英语快速辨识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>态度判断题</strong>：</p>\n<p>判断说话者的态度需要听语气和情感词汇：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>态度</th>\n<th>标志表达</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>赞同</td>\n<td>That&#39;s a great idea. / Absolutely. / I couldn&#39;t agree more.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反对</td>\n<td>I&#39;m afraid I can&#39;t agree. / That&#39;s not quite right. / I doubt it.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>犹豫</td>\n<td>Well, I&#39;m not sure. / It depends. / Let me think about it.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惊讶</td>\n<td>Really? / You&#39;re kidding! / I can&#39;t believe it!</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建议</td>\n<td>Why don&#39;t you... / How about... / I suggest...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-常见听力场景与高频词汇\">三、常见听力场景与高频词汇</h3><p>高考听力的场景相对固定。熟悉以下场景及其高频词汇能大幅提高理解速度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>高频词汇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>购物</td>\n<td>price, discount, size, receipt, on sale, try on, pay by cash/card</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>餐厅</td>\n<td>order, menu, bill, waiter, reserve a table, main course, dessert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机场/交通</td>\n<td>flight, delay, boarding gate, departure, arrival, platform, round trip</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酒店</td>\n<td>check in/out, single/double room, reservation, room service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>医院</td>\n<td>appointment, symptom, prescription, examination, temperature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学校</td>\n<td>assignment, deadline, lecture, semester, tuition, drop a course</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天气</td>\n<td>forecast, cloudy, shower, temperature drop, clear up</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作</td>\n<td>interview, salary, resign, promotion, overtime, apply for</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-长对话和独白的听取策略\">四、长对话和独白的听取策略</h3><p>长对话和独白的难度高于短对话，因为信息量大、干扰项多。</p>\n<p><strong>长对话策略</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>预读所有题目，标出每题的关键词</li>\n<li>第一遍听：捕捉与题目对应的关键信息</li>\n<li>题目的顺序通常与对话内容的顺序一致——听到第一题的信息后马上准备听第二题</li>\n<li>对话中的转折词（but, however, actually）后面通常是重要信息</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>独白策略</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>独白通常有明确的结构：开头引入 → 中间展开 → 结尾总结</li>\n<li>独白开头的第一句通常揭示主题</li>\n<li>留意列举信号词（first, second, finally）和强调信号词（most importantly, the key point is）</li>\n<li>结尾处可能出现总结性信息，对应最后一题</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"五-听力常见陷阱\">五、听力常见陷阱</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息修正</td>\n<td>先说一个信息后改口</td>\n<td>&quot;The meeting is at 3... no wait, it&#39;s at 3:30.&quot; 答案是 3:30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干扰项前置</td>\n<td>先提到错误选项的关键词</td>\n<td>先说 &quot;I thought about going to the park&quot; 后说 &quot;but decided to stay home&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同音混淆</td>\n<td>近音词混淆</td>\n<td>right / write, their / there, week / weak</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>言外之意</td>\n<td>说话者没有直接表态</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;d love to, but I have to study.&quot; 实际意思是拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概括vs细节</td>\n<td>问的是总结，但听到的是具体细节</td>\n<td>选项是概括性的，需要从多个细节推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-日常训练方法\">六、日常训练方法</h3><p><strong>方法一：精听训练</strong></p>\n<p>选取一段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的听力材料：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>第一遍：不看文本，听大意</li>\n<li>第二遍：逐句暂停，写下听到的每个词</li>\n<li>第三遍：对照文本，标出漏听和听错的部分</li>\n<li>第四遍：跟读（shadowing），模仿语音语调</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每天 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟精听训练，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后听力水平会有显著提升。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：泛听训练</strong></p>\n<p>利用碎片时间听英语材料（VOA 慢速英语、BBC Learning English、TED-Ed），不求逐词理解，培养整体语感和英语思维反应速度。</p>\n<p><strong>方法三：真题模拟</strong></p>\n<p>每周至少做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 套完整的高考听力真题，严格模拟考场条件（只放一遍、限时作答）。做完后重听错题部分，分析错因。</p>\n<p><strong>方法四：场景词汇专项</strong></p>\n<p>每周聚焦一个听力场景（如本周：机场/交通），集中学习该场景的高频词汇和表达，然后做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 段该场景的听力材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选取一套高考听力真题，做之前先用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟预读所有题目，在每题旁边写出你预判的场景和关键词。做完后检查预判的准确率。</li>\n<li>找一段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的英语新闻，进行精听训练：逐句听写 → 对照原文 → 标出错误 → 跟读。记录你的听写正确率。</li>\n<li>统计你最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 次听力模拟的错题，按&quot;数字题&quot;&quot;态度题&quot;&quot;细节题&quot;&quot;推理题&quot;分类，找出你最薄弱的题型。</li>\n<li>针对&quot;信息修正&quot;陷阱进行专项训练：找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 道含修正信息的听力题，刻意练习捕捉&quot;actually&quot;&quot;I mean&quot;&quot;wait&quot;等修正信号词。</li>\n<li>制定一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周听力训练计划：每天精听 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 泛听 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 每周 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 套真题模拟。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>VOA Special English 和 BBC Learning English 的慢速材料是入门级听力训练的优质资源，语速约每分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span></span></span></span></span> 词。</li>\n<li>英语听力的&quot;连读&quot;&quot;弱读&quot;&quot;吞音&quot;现象是中国学生听力的主要障碍，专项学习语音知识有助于突破这些障碍。</li>\n<li>影视作品（如配有英文字幕的英语电影）是提升听力兴趣和实战能力的好工具，但要注意&quot;看字幕&quot;不等于&quot;练听力&quot;。</li>\n<li>高考听力的语速约为每分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span> 词，接近正常英语会话的语速下限，因此不必追求&quot;快速听力&quot;的训练。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高考听力的备考核心是&quot;预判 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 捕捉 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 避坑&quot;。预判技巧利用间歇时间预读题目，提取问题类型和选项差异；关键信息捕捉训练&quot;选择性聆听&quot;能力，不求逐词翻译而求精准抓取；避坑意识针对信息修正、干扰项前置、同音混淆和言外之意四种常见陷阱。日常训练以精听为核心（每天 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟），辅以泛听培养语感和每周真题模拟保持手感。高频场景词汇的积累是提速的基础——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 大常考场景各掌握 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 个关键词，听力理解速度会有质的飞跃。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 听力训练","id":"高三英语-听力训练"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、听力的预判策略","id":"一-听力的预判策略"},{"level":3,"text":"二、关键信息捕捉技巧","id":"二-关键信息捕捉技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"三、常见听力场景与高频词汇","id":"三-常见听力场景与高频词汇"},{"level":3,"text":"四、长对话和独白的听取策略","id":"四-长对话和独白的听取策略"},{"level":3,"text":"五、听力常见陷阱","id":"五-听力常见陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"六、日常训练方法","id":"六-日常训练方法"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 写作模板","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/writing-templates"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 模拟卷解析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/mock-practice/mock-exam-analysis"}}